OL,3,AHollywood actor Luke Evans on 'joyous'
OL,4,Afour months filming in rainy Wales
OL,5,
OL,6,FHollywood actor Luke Evans said filming
OL,7,Fjust 25 minutes from his childhood home
OL,8,Fwas "joyous" - and some family members
OL,9,Feven made a cameo in the final episode
OL,10,Fof his new drama.
OL,12,FThe Pontypool-born star, who is also an
OL,13,Fexecutive producer of the five-part
OL,14,Fseries, The Party, came up with the
OL,15,Fidea to adapt the acclaimed novel by
OL,16,FElizabeth Day into a drama for the
OL,17,Fscreen.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
