OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AHollywood actor Luke Evans on 'joyous'
OL,4,Afour months filming in rainy Wales
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor the first time in 30 years, Evans
OL,7,Fwas able to film close to Aberbargoed,
OL,8,FCaerphilly county, where he grew up, as
OL,9,Fthe drama was shot in Cardiff and
OL,10,FBridgend.
OL,12,FThe star of Beauty and the Beast,
OL,13,FImmortals and The Hobbit had been used
OL,14,Fto being far from home while working on
OL,15,Fthe stage and films.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
